WezTerm
=======

macOS only. No leader key: herdr owns panes and sessions.

CUSTOM
  cmd-shift-d                     New tab running herdr --remote desk --remote-keybindings
                                  server
  Left Option is Alt (for alt-c, alt-b/f). Right Option types special characters.

TABS AND WINDOWS
  cmd-t / cmd-w                   New / close tab
  cmd-1..8 / cmd-9                Go to tab N / last tab
  cmd-shift-[ / cmd-shift-]       Previous / next tab
  cmd-n                           New window

SCROLLBACK AND TEXT
  cmd-f                           Search the scrollback
  cmd-k                           Clear the scrollback
  shift-pageup / shift-pagedown   Scroll a page
  ctrl-shift-x                    Copy mode
  ctrl-shift-space                Quick select (copy a hash, path or URL)
  ctrl-shift-u                    Pick a character or emoji

CONFIG AND TOOLS
  cmd-= / cmd-- / cmd-0           Font bigger / smaller / reset
  cmd-r                           Reload the config
  ctrl-shift-p                    Command palette
  ctrl-shift-l                    Debug overlay
